  "_comment": "Palette sampled programmatically from the official Kare Plus logo at public/images/kareplus-rugby-logo.jpeg. Navy #0E3F89 and green #A0C57F are the measured brand colours. NOTE: the brand green is only 1.95:1 on white, so it must NEVER carry text or convey meaning on its own - use accent-text (#657C50) for anything readable. Run scripts/check-contrast.mjs after any change; it exits non-zero on failure.",
